          "text": "Nuko rer’ uvuge, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Nah’ abo nabangarije kure mu banyamahanga, kandi naho nabasābagirije mu bindi bihugu, ariko nzomara igihe mbabereye umwanya wera mu bihugu bagiyemwo. ",
