          "text": "Nuko rer’ uvuge, ut’ Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Nzobakoranya mbakūre mu mahanga, kandi mbakoranirize hamwe mbakūye mu bihugu aho mwari mwarasābagirijwe, maze mbahe igihugu c’i Bgisirayeli. ",
