          "text": "Maze Mpwemu aranterura, mbona ansubiza i Bukaludaya ku bajanywe ar’ inyagano, ndi mur’ ukwo kwerekwa neretswe na Mpwemu w’Imana. Maz’ ukwo kwerekwa nabonye guca kumvako. ",
